<!-- wp:divi/text {"module":{"decoration":{"background":{"desktop":{"value":{"color":"#141630"}}},"spacing":{"desktop":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"26px","right":"28px","bottom":"25px","left":"28px","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"},"margin":{"top":"18px","right":"0px","bottom":"","left":"0px","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}},"tablet":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"24px","right":"24px","bottom":"23px","left":"24px","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"},"margin":{"top":"14px","right":"0px","bottom":"","left":"0px","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}},"phone":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"14.3px","bottom":"13.75px","left":"28px","right":"28px","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"},"margin":{"top":"14px","bottom":"","left":"0px","right":"","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}}},"border":{"desktop":{"value":{"radius":{"sync":"on","topLeft":"16px","topRight":"16px","bottomRight":"16px","bottomLeft":"16px"}}}},"layout":{"desktop":{"value":{"display":"block"}}},"sizing":{"desktop":{"value":{"width":"82%","maxWidth":"410px","alignment":"left"}},"tablet":{"value":{"width":"90%","maxWidth":"520px","alignment":"center"}}},"boxShadow":{"desktop":{"value":{"style":"preset2","horizontal":"0px","vertical":"20px","blur":"45px","spread":"-24px","color":"rgba(20,22,48,0.70)"}}}}},"content":{"decoration":{"bodyFont":{"body":{"font":{"desktop":{"value":{"family":"Montserrat","weight":"400","color":"#d7d9e2","size":"15px","lineHeight":"1.65em"}}}}}},"innerContent":{"desktop":{"value":"<p style=\"color:#141630;font-size:30px;\">“</p><p>At BD Star, we don't just transport people—we connect destinations and create memorable journeys</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;\">BD Star</p><p>Transport and Shuttle</p>"}}},"builderVersion":"5.0.0-public-beta.1"} /-->
<!-- /wp:divi/column -->

<!-- wp:divi/column  {"module":{"advanced":{"type":{"desktop":{"value":"1_2"}}},"decoration":{"spacing":{"desktop":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"3.2%","right":"","bottom":"3.2%","left":"0px","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}},"tablet":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"0px","right":"","bottom":"0px","left":"0px","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}},"phone":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"3.2%","bottom":"3.2%","left":"0px","right":"","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}}},"layout":{"desktop":{"value":{"display":"block"}}}}},"builderVersion":"5.0.0-public-alpha.18.2"} -->
<!-- wp:divi/text {"module":{"meta":{"adminLabel":{"desktop":{"value":"Title"}}},"decoration":{"sizing":{"desktop":{"value":{"maxWidth":"700px","alignment":"left"}}},"layout":{"desktop":{"value":{"display":"block"}}},"spacing":{"desktop":{"value":{"margin":{"top":"","right":"","bottom":"24px","left":"","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}},"phone":{"value":{"margin":{"top":"","bottom":"13.2px","left":"","right":"","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}}}}},"content":{"decoration":{"bodyFont":{"body":{"font":{"desktop":{"value":{"family":"Montserrat","weight":"400","color":"$variable({\"type\":\"color\",\"value\":{\"name\":\"gcid-about-eyebrow\",\"settings\":{}}})$","size":"16px","lineHeight":"1.9em"}}}}},"headingFont":{"h1":{"font":{"desktop":{"value":{"textAlign":"left"}}}},"h2":{"font":{"desktop":{"value":{"family":"Montserrat","weight":"700","capitalization":"none","color":"$variable({\"type\":\"color\",\"value\":{\"name\":\"gcid-about-heading\",\"settings\":{}}})$","size":"40px","lineHeight":"1.18em"}}}}}},"innerContent":{"desktop":{"value":"<p>our story</p><h2>Dedicated to Safe, Reliable Island Travel</h2>"}}},"builderVersion":"5.0.0-public-beta.1","locked":{"desktop":{"value":"off"}}} /-->

<!-- wp:divi/text {"module":{"meta":{"adminLabel":{"desktop":{"value":"Subtitle"}}},"decoration":{"sizing":{"desktop":{"value":{"maxWidth":"700px","alignment":"left"}}},"spacing":{"desktop":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"","right":"","bottom":"18px","left":"","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}},"phone":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"","bottom":"9.9px","left":"","right":"","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}}},"layout":{"desktop":{"value":{"display":"block"}}}}},"content":{"decoration":{"bodyFont":{"body":{"font":{"desktop":{"value":{"family":"Montserrat","weight":"400","color":"$variable({\"type\":\"color\",\"value\":{\"name\":\"gcid-about-body\",\"settings\":{}}})$","size":"17px","lineHeight":"1.75em"}}}}}},"innerContent":{"desktop":{"value":"<p>When traveling with your family in Punta Cana, safety and reliability are paramount. B.D Star Transport specializes in providing secure, comfortable transportation for families visiting the Dominican Republic. Our professional drivers know every route in Punta Cana, from Punta Cana International Airport (PUJ) to your resort, ensuring smooth, stress-free transfers.</p>"}}},"builderVersion":"5.0.0-public-beta.1","locked":{"desktop":{"value":"off"}}} /-->

<!-- wp:divi/text {"module":{"meta":{"adminLabel":{"desktop":{"value":"Subtitle"}}},"decoration":{"sizing":{"desktop":{"value":{"maxWidth":"700px","alignment":"left"}}},"spacing":{"desktop":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"","right":"","bottom":"18px","left":"","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}},"phone":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"","bottom":"9.9px","left":"","right":"","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}}},"layout":{"desktop":{"value":{"display":"block"}}}}},"content":{"decoration":{"bodyFont":{"body":{"font":{"desktop":{"value":{"family":"Montserrat","weight":"400","color":"$variable({\"type\":\"color\",\"value\":{\"name\":\"gcid-about-body\",\"settings\":{}}})$","size":"17px","lineHeight":"1.75em"}}}}}},"innerContent":{"desktop":{"value":"<p>We understand the unique needs of family travel. That's why all our vehicles are equipped with child safety seats upon request, and our drivers are trained in customer service and safety protocols. Whether you need an airport pickup, hotel transfer, or a private tour of local attractions, we're here to make your family vacation memorable for all the right reasons.</p><p>Our fleet includes spacious SUVs and vans that accommodate families of all sizes, with room for luggage and beach equipment. We offer 24/7 service, transparent pricing with no hidden fees, and easy booking through our website or WhatsApp. Join thousands of satisfied families who've trusted B.D Star for their Punta Cana transportation needs.</p>"}}},"builderVersion":"5.0.0-public-beta.1","locked":{"desktop":{"value":"off"}}} /-->

<!-- wp:divi/text {"module":{"meta":{"adminLabel":{"desktop":{"value":"Trust Highlights Grid"}}},"decoration":{"sizing":{"desktop":{"value":{"maxWidth":"700px","alignment":"left"}}},"spacing":{"desktop":{"value":{"margin":{"top":"10px","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}},"phone":{"value":{"margin":{"top":"5.5px","bottom":"","left":"","right":"","syncVertical":"off","syncHorizontal":"off"}}}},"layout":{"desktop":{"value":{"display":"block"}}}}},"content":{"innerContent":{"desktop":{"value":"<div class=\"bd-about-trust-grid\"><div class=\"bd-family-trust-item\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4 10 4 4 8-8\" stroke=\"#141630\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Licensed &amp; Insured</span></div><div class=\"bd-family-trust-item\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4 10 4 4 8-8\" stroke=\"#141630\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>10+ Years Experience</span></div><div class=\"bd-family-trust-item\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4 10 4 4 8-8\" stroke=\"#141630\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Child Seats Available</span></div><div class=\"bd-family-trust-item\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4 10 4 4 8-8\" stroke=\"#141630\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>5-Star TripAdvisor Rated</span></div></div>"}}},"builderVersion":"5.0.0-public-beta.1","locked":{"desktop":{"value":"off"}}} /-->
